WEBVTT

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:31.900
Yes?

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:36.010
Kokoro, you're up.  This is Dad.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:43.850
It seems like you haven't used much money.  Are you eating well?

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.170
I've been eating.

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:47.600
I'm fine.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.850
I'm going to school, so I'm hanging up.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:28.190
We're late!  We're late!

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:34.830
Go for it.

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:36.850
Okay.

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:40.880
All right, bye.  Be a good girl and play nicely with your friends.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.240
Bye!

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:47.980
That's great...

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:48.870
What is?

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.840
You know, Sakashita Yuzuyu-chan's...?

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:52.960
Ah.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.650
We're going to be starting soon!

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.310
Everyone please come inside!

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.980
Okay!

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.050
Please hurry.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:09.670
Okay!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.880
Ouch.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:26.800
Move, move!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.090
I'll step on you if you're sitting in a place like this.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.010
What happened to you?  You're hurt.

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:40.750
I fell just now.

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:44.310
I have a bandage; I'll give it to you.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:45.980
Don't cry.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:47.270
Here.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:51.640
Thank you!

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:55.400
You're Yuzuyu, right?

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:03.480
You don't have a mom or dad, so your cousin is taking care of you.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.650
That's what the ladies were saying.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.480
You're so lucky to have such a cool nii-chan.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:17.950
Bye.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.790
Yuzuyu-chan.  Why are you sitting here?

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.190
Yuzuyu-chan?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.600
Come on, Kippei, please?

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:51.910
No way.

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:55.060
I want to try eating at this restaurant.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:06:00.850
On Saturday from 4pm to 6pm it's really cheap if you go as a couple.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:05.000
I don't have any money and besides, we're not a couple, so...

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:10.290
I'll pay for it and we can just become a couple.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.700
Let's go!  Let's go!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.390
Huh?  Last time you said,

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:18.400
"You're going to die alone," and dumped me, so I don't want to!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.320
Just forget about that.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:25.850
And anyway, what's gotten into you?

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:27.570
Tell me.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:31.550
You know how you're taking care of a child?

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:35.370
I thought you were unreliable.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:38.320
I didn't think you could do such a thing.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:43.040
And then I realized my hidden love for you.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:53.920
Hey!  Listen to me!

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:56.830
I'm serious!

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:25.280
Kokoro-chan.

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:40.080
Hey!

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.150
You made her all mad!

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:43.550
What is it?!

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:49.440
Kokoro-chan!  Wait!

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.510
That was really a misunderstanding.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:54.910
Can I help you with something?

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:58.660
I'm really sorry.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.100
Why don't you go be with Natsu?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.660
No, Natsu really doesn't mean anything to me.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.090
Kokoro-chan, you don't know Natsu, right?

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:12.260
I'm not with you for the sake of Yuzuyu-chan.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.270
Yeah.  T-That's right.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:20.870
But you're always with another girl.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:23.940
Y-Yeah.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.510
Kokoro-chan?

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:37.590
Never mind.

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:39.740
Just forget what I said.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:42.100
It's fine, so just do whatever you want.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.040
What is this?

00:08:57.940 --> 00:08:59.010
So childish.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:33.040
Never mind.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:34.900
Just forget what I said.

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:37.390
It's fine, so just do whatever you want.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.820
Kokoro-chan!

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:48.250
Oh man, so funny!

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.830
Kokoro, Kippei cuts class too much, huh?

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:00.410
Why does he even bother coming to school?

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:09.110
Kokoro-chin...

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:17.840
Kokoro-chin.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:23.680
Kokoro, that's the last one.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.210
Kokoro-chi...?

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:35.060
Sh-She ran away.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:44.590
Kokoro-chan.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:53.840
Come here!

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:54.910
No!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.270
It's okay.

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.720
Don't worry about me.  Leave me alone.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.630
I said don't worry!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:16.210
Yuzuyu is important to me,

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:21.350
but out of all the girls, I like you the most.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.310
Come here, Kokoro-chan.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:49.240
There, there.

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.260
I'm not Yuzuyu, you know?

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.320
What did you do that for, Kokoro-chan?!

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:27.900
Do you like me or not?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.730
Here.  Hurry up and go.

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.920
If you're late again, Yuzuyu-chan is going to hate you.

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:40.310
Oh yeah.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.090
Bye.

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:53.110
It seems like Kokoro-chan is trying harder than me.

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:56.640
How long am I supposed to restrain myself?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:04.730
I promise that one day I will come back strong,

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:11.290
but until then, please take care of Yuzuyu for me.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:22.940
Kokoro...

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:26.120
What was that just now?!

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.300
This is a school!

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:29.830
Kokoro-san!

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.030
I wonder what that was.

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:43.110
Kippei is so sly.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:02.470
Won't someone hang out with me?

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:12.380
Kippei's raising a child, and who was that girl anyway?

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.640
Kokoro-chan.

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:21.350
Kokoro, huh?

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.390
Oh, that's Kippei's girlfriend.

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:26.740
What?  G-Girlfriend?!

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.460
Yeah, I heard a rumor about that.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.330
Tokunaga Kokoro.

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:34.740
I was in the same class with her my first year.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:40.440
Kippei!

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:43.970
Natsu!  Long time no see!

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.020
What do you mean long time no see?

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:47.960
I just saw you earlier.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.300
Never mind that.  I want to ask you something.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.430
Is it true that you like Tokunaga-san?!

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.330
What kind of interrogation is this?

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.080
It's a rumor.

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:04.140
Is it true or not?!  Answer me!

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:07.340
Yup, I like her.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.260
Wait, so you're not going to me or anything anymore?!

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:14.160
What's wrong?

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.790
You're not going to or what?!

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.690
Yeah, I can't.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:25.250
Let me hit you in the head!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:27.370
That's not like you, Kippei!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.760
S-Stop it!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:34.310
You should follow my lead and get into a serious relationship.

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:35.430
See you.

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:39.730
I'm so grossed out!

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:41.550
That's not Kippei!

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:43.960
Kippei seemed pretty serious.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.980
Right, Natsumi?

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:50.960
What's wrong?

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:53.940
I don't know.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:58.990
The tears just keep coming out and it feels like there's a hole in my heart.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:00.800
I'm so sad.

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:03.400
Natsumi...

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:07.650
I was okay with just fooling around with Kippei.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.050
That was fun.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:12.060
But...

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:18.290
But maybe I really liked Kippei.

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.520
Don't tell Kippei.

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:25.820
I won't.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.390
I would be so embarrassed that I cried.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:34.090
I'll be the one that remembers how you feel.

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:53.090
Everyone!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:57.670
Let's clean up the toys you used and change your clothes!

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.060
Okay!

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:07.190
I'll carry half for you.

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:14.900
Thank you!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:20.450
It's fine.  I'm a boy, so I'm stronger than a girl is.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:24.750
What's your name?

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:28.890
Nashiya Shouta, Cherry Blossom group.

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:31.610
Shou-chan?

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:36.470
Shou-chan sounds like a girl's name, but that's okay.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.760
I'm in the Peach group.

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:53.180
Yuzuyu!

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.760
Come here a second.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.530
What is it?

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:02.030
Do you know how to make a rainbow?

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.520
Rainbow?

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:20.580
Me too!

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:22.110
Can you do it?

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:29.950
Don't spray it on me!

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.450
Darn you!  You bad girl!

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.100
Now you've done it!

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:45.540
Now you've done it!

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:49.790
W-What are you two doing?

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.070
You can't do that.

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:01.200
I'll bring you some towels, so wait right here, okay?

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:02.500
Okay!

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.610
I'm soaking wet.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:11.960
What happened here?

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.270
Don't touch me, you pervert!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.170
Pervert?

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.140
I fell.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.900
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:41.020
You sure are energetic.

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:42.640
Have you been a good girl?

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:47.150
What is it?  You're acting suspiciously.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.810
Katakura-san, take this.

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:54.710
What's this?

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:56.860
I played with water!

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:06.060
Shou-kun, bye-bye!

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:08.470
See ya!

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:12.460
Does Shou-chan's mom pick him up late?

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:17.210
It seems so.  Shou-chan is always waiting until very late.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:06.570
It's not like that...

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:14.960
It's not like that at all.

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:22.000
It's not the child that's bad.

00:23:26.310 --> 00:23:30.990
Hey, do you think it's okay if I talk to him as a friend just like before?

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:32.840
I think that's fine.

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:38.270
Kippei!  Good morning!

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:40.960
Good morning, Natsu!

00:23:41.800 --> 00:23:43.780
What are you eating this early in the morning?

00:23:44.220 --> 00:23:45.240
Want half?

00:23:46.180 --> 00:23:48.760
I didn't have time to eat since I had to stop at the preschool.

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:55.500
Kippei, I learned about love from an unexpected source,

00:23:56.270 --> 00:23:59.940
but please don't notice my feelings.

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:03.100
I'll eat some!

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:05.870
Is it okay for me to take an entire half?

00:24:06.120 --> 00:24:08.730
Our friendship is that strong!

00:24:09.050 --> 00:24:10.100
That's true.

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:14.710
Delicious!

00:24:20.170 --> 00:24:21.510
Ta-da!

00:24:22.380 --> 00:24:24.190
Nee-chan, you're going overboard.

00:24:24.410 --> 00:24:25.610
Amazing!

00:24:25.770 --> 00:24:28.120
It's Parent's Day at Yuzuyu-chan's school.

00:24:28.360 --> 00:24:30.100
We can't have people messing with us.

00:24:30.230 --> 00:24:32.240
But just because of that?

00:24:32.740 --> 00:24:34.590
I'm going to be performing.

00:24:35.200 --> 00:24:36.060
I'm going to be dancing.

00:24:36.340 --> 00:24:37.730
I'm so nervous!

00:24:38.880 --> 00:24:40.680
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:41.380 --> 00:24:43.770
Onee-sama Goes to Parents' Day!
